WEBVTT

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.000
Welcome, travellers… to Saint-Geniès.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.700
I am Brother Aymeric, Knight of the Temple.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:17.000
Leave your steeds here… and join me in front of the great sign by the church.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.000
That is where our quest begins.
